om/v/t64.5771-25/491821799_1191477622448986_335158506262625688_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eCFtYH6GQzUQ7kNvwHNsgBQ&_nc_oc=AdokutISfm56MTwoBFxfay6UwwacQpMEieI92ACedKSAOO23pFnsvFmKYRJd_NG_wq0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQaPx-k0AsHtqrcuJoitbbvexo0587I12nFkNUid0JHOQ&oe=6B09B5F7"}, {"file_name": "screenshot.png", "id": "1014885264124822", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819375_1014885267458155_4732627606674535666_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Eh5AV3BHwRIQ7kNvwGv1OMi&_nc_oc=Adp-9WVQ9kc0jeI-Hovc0oVWxy8PbSmIxSIsVYWHS2vgp5uAL03wKh9aKK-AHWOc2s8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSubvQZRjrz7MKTW7hp9Bqrl3qbJZk2WElWliux1bVTjw&oe=6B099FA5"}, {"file_name": "screenshot2.png", "id": "592606743148111", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391923_592606746481444_8966562253819213417_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Aewn4WdPcHkQ7kNvwHRBNTU&_nc_oc=Adpah4ZIVxbP1rhGagAj4zXLCiBlUnngMjHks0tKvuE7xqqRCrJhLlqBpr7HQPVBZo0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSPeP9wtBJDMU4hS9oY45NmA7UYCPp2C6HIeVpDg8mAWg&oe=6B09AAD5"}, {"file_name": "screenshot4.png", "id": "3508709025927990", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391985_3508709029261323_3016583868344724243_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-fEYlAMATggQ7kNvwHkPcSJ&_nc_oc=AdrximlMKnuqoD3V0Dt5dLyc8jk--HlJo2RbXh9um-Z3PYpmDpmKFdSq-G0s5iiv2bM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSd_vPHvIhkPSD4HUUwH4GlU9p7MlJdHCSC9V9rn2I-9g&oe=6B09B4E7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1333140684643275", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391976_1333140687976608_7978945902575114739_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=04PDiHfHmA0Q7kNvwGnVlfZ&_nc_oc=AdqKUmGuqDOZrM7lkaORwYBxffujhIIDtIaFY-eKicU1GHmmxL1iVPkXXbW0cNC8kPc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSrreNkAyMFNEjxJaSOWFrzR-_u7OWBOTB6orFqyCLkcw&oe=6B09B950"}, "display_name": "Fit Beat Combat : Free Style Boxing", "keywords": ["Fitness", "Boxing"], "long_description": "# Catch the Rhythm, Punch Your Way to Fit in VR!\n\nTired of boring workouts? Ready to **truly enjoy** getting fit? Welcome to **Fit Beat Combat Boxing**! Experience an exhilarating **VR fitness game** on Meta Quest where rhythm meets power! This isn't just another game \u2013 it's your personal boxing ring, high-energy dance floor, and path to a healthier, stronger you. An addictive **VR workout** challenge!\n\n# Feel the Beat, Land the Punch!\n\nDynamic VR arenas meet heart-pumping music. Simple controls: put on your Quest headset (2, 3, or Pro) & move! Notes sync to infectious beats. Unleash your inner champion! **Jab, cross, hook, and uppercut** notes with precision. **Duck and weave** past obstacles, keeping your body moving and heart rate soaring. Intuitive, exhilarating, fun **full-body workout** to make you sweat! Perfect for cardio and calorie burning!\n\n# Your Personal Coach Awaits!\n\nYou're not alone. Our expert **virtual instructor** guides form, pushes you, & cheers you on. Learn technique and feel the burn. Adapts for **beginners** to **fitness pros** to keep you motivated.\n\n# Workout Your Way!\n\nDitch boring apps & gyms! **Fit Beat Combat Boxing** is your fun, effective fitness routine. Smash beats to reach goals like **weight loss**, boosting **stamina**, improving **coordination**, or **stress relief**!\n\n# Key Features:\n\n- **Rhythm Boxing Gameplay:** Punch, duck, dodge to music! Music & exercise.\n- **Full-Body Workout:** Arms, core, legs workout for max calorie burn.\n- **Engaging Soundtrack:** Energizing music keeps you moving.\n\n\n", "short_desc